  "caption": "The stagger screen: two screens in a row, and one read that decides the possession. A tactics board in 36 seconds.",
  "pinnedComment": "Stagger screen: when the defender trails tight, the shooter curls to the rim. When the defender goes under, he fades to the wing. Which read is harder to guard?",
